(function() {
    'use strict';

    class PharmaLaunchAdapter extends USF.SimulationAdapter {
        constructor() {
            super();
            this.name = 'Pharmaceutical Launch Strategy: Pipeline to Market';
            this.version = '1.1.0';
            this.UNIT = 250000;
            this.TOTAL_BUDGET = 18000000;
            this.ROUNDS = [
                {
                    name_en: 'Pre-Launch Setup (Months -3 to 0)',
                    name_es: 'Preparacion Pre-Lanzamiento (Meses -3 a 0)',
                    tranche: 5000000,
                    briefing_en: '<b>You are 90 days from launch day.</b> Your regulatory dossier for CARDIVEX (empavatin) has been approved, but the drug is not on any formulary. Without formulary listing, patients must pay 100% out of pocket — commercial death for a chronic disease drug.<br><br><b>Payer Intelligence Report:</b><br>Payer Alpha (largest social security system): Accepts ICER up to $25,000/QALY. Requires a full pharmacoeconomic dossier.<br>Payer Beta (second largest): Requires budget-neutrality analysis plus a mandatory risk-sharing agreement.<br><br>Allocate your first $5M tranche across the six strategic levers. Market Access (A) and Medical Affairs (B) yield the highest early ROI — but you must also begin building salesforce infrastructure.<br><br><em>Warning: Underspending on Lever A now will permanently exclude CARDIVEX from Payer Beta formulary for the entire simulation.</em>',
                    briefing_es: '<b>Faltan 90 dias para el lanzamiento.</b> El expediente regulatorio de CARDIVEX (empavatin) ha sido aprobado, pero el medicamento no esta en ningun formulario. Sin inclusion en formulario, los pacientes deben pagar el 100% — muerte comercial para un medicamento de enfermedad cronica.<br><br><b>Reporte de Inteligencia de Pagadores:</b><br>Pagador Alpha (sistema de seguridad social mas grande): Acepta ICER hasta $25,000/QALY. Requiere un dossier farmacoeconomico completo.<br>Pagador Beta (segundo mas grande): Requiere analisis de neutralidad presupuestal mas un acuerdo obligatorio de riesgo compartido.<br><br>Asigne su primer tramo de $5M entre las seis palancas estrategicas. Acceso al Mercado (A) y Asuntos Medicos (B) producen el mayor ROI temprano — pero tambien debe comenzar a construir infraestructura de fuerza de ventas.<br><br><em>Advertencia: Subinvertir en Palanca A ahora excluira permanentemente a CARDIVEX del formulario del Pagador Beta durante toda la simulacion.</em>'
                },
                {
                    name_en: 'Formulary Access Campaign (Months 1-6)',
                    name_es: 'Campana de Acceso a Formulario (Meses 1-6)',
                    tranche: 4000000,
                    briefing_en: '<b>Launch day has arrived.</b> GLORIAX sales reps are proactively calling your top 200 target prescribers. Your KOL engagement strategy will determine whether leading endocrinologists become CARDIVEX advocates or remain neutral.<br><br><b>Formulary Negotiations Active:</b><br>Payer Alpha has invited a pharmacoeconomic dossier submission — but only if you invested at least $1.5M in Market Access last round.<br>Hospital Formulary Committees are meeting. Teams with strong KOL engagement (Lever B) have a champion willing to present.<br>Private Insurance Consortium is requesting a net price rebate proposal.<br><br><b>Market Event:</b> A cluster of GI adverse events has been reported in the first 500 patients. How you respond affects long-term credibility. Proactive reporting costs short-term sales but builds trust.',
                    briefing_es: '<b>El dia del lanzamiento ha llegado.</b> Los representantes de GLORIAX estan llamando proactivamente a sus 200 principales prescriptores objetivo. Su estrategia de engagement con KOLs determinara si los endocrinologos lideres se convierten en defensores de CARDIVEX o permanecen neutrales.<br><br><b>Negociaciones de Formulario Activas:</b><br>El Pagador Alpha ha invitado a presentar un dossier farmacoeconomico — pero solo si invirtio al menos $1.5M en Acceso al Mercado en la ronda anterior.<br>Los Comites de Formulario Hospitalario estan sesionando. Equipos con fuerte engagement de KOLs (Palanca B) tienen un defensor dispuesto a presentar.<br>El Consorcio de Seguros Privados solicita una propuesta de descuento sobre precio neto.<br><br><b>Evento de Mercado:</b> Se ha reportado un grupo de eventos adversos GI en los primeros 500 pacientes. Su respuesta afecta la credibilidad a largo plazo. El reporte proactivo cuesta ventas a corto plazo pero construye confianza.'
                },
                {
                    name_en: 'Salesforce Activation (Months 7-12)',
                    name_es: 'Activacion de Fuerza de Ventas (Meses 7-12)',
                    tranche: 4000000,
                    briefing_en: '<b>Formulary status is now determined.</b> The commercial machine must convert prescriber access into written prescriptions. Teams that over-invested in market access with insufficient salesforce infrastructure face the "access without volume" trap.<br><br><b>Salesforce Model Impact:</b><br>Lean (up to $1.5M on C): 40 reps covering top 200 specialists only<br>Balanced ($1.5M-$3M on C): 80 reps covering 500 specialists plus 2,000 PCPs<br>Intensive (above $3M on C): 140 reps with full market coverage<br><br><b>Key Constraint:</b> Each rep conducts 2,000 calls/year. Minimum 6 calls/year per physician needed for meaningful prescription change. Regulatory compliance requires 30% of each detail covers safety information.<br><br>Teams that switch from Lean to Intensive mid-simulation face a ramp-up penalty — recruiting, hiring, and training 100 new reps takes time.',
                    briefing_es: '<b>El estatus de formulario ya esta determinado.</b> La maquina comercial debe convertir el acceso a prescriptores en recetas escritas. Equipos que sobreinvirtieron en acceso al mercado con infraestructura insuficiente de fuerza de ventas enfrentan la trampa de "acceso sin volumen".<br><br><b>Impacto del Modelo de Fuerza de Ventas:</b><br>Lean (hasta $1.5M en C): 40 reps cubriendo solo los top 200 especialistas<br>Balanceado ($1.5M-$3M en C): 80 reps cubriendo 500 especialistas mas 2,000 medicos generales<br>Intensivo (mas de $3M en C): 140 reps con cobertura total del mercado<br><br><b>Restriccion Clave:</b> Cada rep realiza 2,000 visitas/ano. Se necesitan minimo 6 visitas/ano por medico para un cambio significativo en prescripcion. El cumplimiento regulatorio requiere que el 30% de cada visita cubra informacion de seguridad.<br><br>Equipos que cambian de Lean a Intensivo a mitad de simulacion enfrentan una penalizacion de ramp-up.'
                },
                {
                    name_en: 'Mid-Cycle Optimization (Months 13-24)',
                    name_es: 'Optimizacion de Medio Ciclo (Meses 13-24)',
                    tranche: 3000000,
                    briefing_en: '<b>Month 12 data is in.</b> Review your performance dashboard and diagnose the root cause of any gaps before reallocating resources.<br><br><b>Diagnostic Framework:</b><br>Is this a <em>reach problem</em>? (Not enough prescribers called) — Invest in Salesforce<br>Is this an <em>access problem</em>? (Payers have not listed the drug) — Invest in Market Access<br>Is this a <em>persistence problem</em>? (Patients abandon therapy) — Invest in Patient Support<br>Is this an <em>awareness problem</em>? (HCPs do not know the data) — Invest in Medical Affairs<br><br><b>Competitive Action:</b> GLORIAX has launched a Patient Loyalty Card program — 30% co-pay discount for auto-refill patients. You must decide whether to match this (costly) or differentiate with a digital adherence platform.<br><br><em>Teams that correctly diagnose root causes before reallocating dramatically outperform those that spread resources evenly.</em>',
                    briefing_es: '<b>Los datos del Mes 12 estan listos.</b> Revise su tablero de desempeno y diagnostique la causa raiz de cualquier brecha antes de reasignar recursos.<br><br><b>Marco de Diagnostico:</b><br>Es un <em>problema de alcance</em>? (Pocos prescriptores contactados) — Invertir en Fuerza de Ventas<br>Es un <em>problema de acceso</em>? (Los pagadores no han incluido el medicamento) — Invertir en Acceso al Mercado<br>Es un <em>problema de persistencia</em>? (Los pacientes abandonan la terapia) — Invertir en Soporte al Paciente<br>Es un <em>problema de awareness</em>? (Los medicos no conocen los datos) — Invertir en Asuntos Medicos<br><br><b>Accion Competitiva:</b> GLORIAX ha lanzado un programa de Tarjeta de Lealtad al Paciente — 30% de descuento en copago por recarga automatica. Debe decidir si igualar esto (costoso) o diferenciarse con una plataforma digital de adherencia.<br><br><em>Los equipos que diagnostican correctamente las causas raiz antes de reasignar superan dramaticamente a los que reparten recursos uniformemente.</em>'
                },
                {
                    name_en: 'Generic Defense (Months 25-36)',
                    name_es: 'Defensa contra Genericos (Meses 25-36)',
                    tranche: 2000000,
                    briefing_en: '<b>The empavatin patent expires at Month 36.</b> Three generic manufacturers have filed abbreviated applications. The question is not if generics will enter, but how much franchise value you can preserve.<br><br><b>Defense Options (can combine within budget):</b><br><em>Authorized Generic:</em> Partner with a generic manufacturer ($500K). Captures 35-45% of generic volume at lower margin.<br><em>Formulation Innovation:</em> Launch CARDIVEX XR with separate patent ($2M). Retains 30-40% of branded patients. Cannot be auto-substituted.<br><em>New Indication Filing:</em> Submit for Diabetic Kidney Disease based on EMERALD trial data ($3M). Opens a new patient segment not subject to generic competition.<br><em>Patient Loyalty Program:</em> Aggressive co-pay cards and disease management ($1.5M). Reduces auto-substitution at 60% rate.<br><br><b>Key insight:</b> Teams that invested in Lever F during earlier rounds find these options cost less now — early lifecycle planning pays compound dividends.',
                    briefing_es: '<b>La patente de empavatin expira en el Mes 36.</b> Tres fabricantes de genericos han presentado solicitudes abreviadas. La pregunta no es si entraran los genericos, sino cuanto valor de la franquicia puede preservar.<br><br><b>Opciones de Defensa (se pueden combinar dentro del presupuesto):</b><br><em>Generico Autorizado:</em> Asociarse con un fabricante de genericos ($500K). Captura 35-45% del volumen generico a menor margen.<br><em>Innovacion de Formulacion:</em> Lanzar CARDIVEX XR con patente separada ($2M). Retiene 30-40% de pacientes de marca. No puede ser sustituido automaticamente.<br><em>Nueva Indicacion:</em> Presentar para Enfermedad Renal Diabetica basada en datos del ensayo EMERALD ($3M). Abre un nuevo segmento no sujeto a competencia generica.<br><em>Programa de Lealtad al Paciente:</em> Tarjetas de copago agresivas y gestion de enfermedad ($1.5M). Reduce sustitucion automatica en 60%.<br><br><b>Clave:</b> Equipos que invirtieron en Palanca F en rondas anteriores encuentran estas opciones mas baratas ahora — la planificacion temprana del ciclo de vida paga dividendos compuestos.'
                }
            ];
        }

        initialize(state) {
            var _fresh = !state.history || state.history.length === 0;
            if (_fresh || !state.domainState || Object.keys(state.domainState).length === 0) {
                state.domainState = {
                    budget: 18000000,
                    cumulativeRevenue: 0,
                    marketShare: 0,
                    leiScore: 0,
                    formularyCoverage: 0,
                    kolScore: 0,
                    prescriberReach: 0,
                    persistenceRate: 0,
                    brandAwareness: 0,
                    lifecycleScore: 0,
                    totalLeverA: 0,
                    totalLeverB: 0,
                    totalLeverC: 0,
                    totalLeverD: 0,
                    totalLeverE: 0,
                    totalLeverF: 0,
                    payerBetaExcluded: false,
                    sfModelPrevious: 'none',
                    revenueHistory: [],
                    shareHistory: [],
                    leiHistory: []
                };
            }
            if (_fresh || !state.decisions || Object.keys(state.decisions).length === 0) {
                state.decisions = {
                    leverA: 0,
                    leverB: 0,
                    leverC: 0,
                    leverD: 0,
                    leverE: 0,
                    leverF: 0
                };
            }
            this._attachSliderListeners();
            this._updateBriefing(state);
        }

        _attachSliderListeners() {
            var self = this;
            var sliders = ['leverA', 'leverB', 'leverC', 'leverD', 'leverE', 'leverF'];
            sliders.forEach(function(id) {
                var el = document.getElementById(id);
                if (el) {
                    el.addEventListener('input', function() {
                        self._updateSliderDisplays();
                    });
                }
            });
            this._updateSliderDisplays();
        }

        _updateSliderDisplays() {
            var unit = this.UNIT;
            var total = 0;
            var sliders = ['leverA', 'leverB', 'leverC', 'leverD', 'leverE', 'leverF'];
            var displayIds = ['leverAValue', 'leverBValue', 'leverCValue', 'leverDValue', 'leverEValue', 'leverFValue'];
            for (var i = 0; i < sliders.length; i++) {
                var el = document.getElementById(sliders[i]);
                var dEl = document.getElementById(displayIds[i]);
                if (el && dEl) {
                    var val = parseInt(el.value) * unit;
                    total += val;
                    dEl.textContent = '$' + val.toLocaleString();
                }
            }
            var allocEl = document.getElementById('roundAllocationDisplay');
            if (allocEl) allocEl.textContent = '$' + total.toLocaleString();
        }

        _lang() {
            var l = ((window.mySimulation && (window.mySimulation.language || window.mySimulation.currentLanguage)) || document.documentElement.lang || 'en');
            l = ('' + l).substring(0, 2).toLowerCase();
            return (l === 'es') ? 'es' : 'en';
        }

        _updateBriefing(state) {
            var idx = Math.min((state.currentPeriod || 1) - 1, this.ROUNDS.length - 1);
            var round = this.ROUNDS[idx];
            var lang = this._lang();
            var briefEl = document.getElementById('briefingText');
            if (briefEl) {
                briefEl.innerHTML = lang === 'es' ? round.briefing_es : round.briefing_en;
            }
            var roundNameEl = document.getElementById('roundNameDisplay');
            if (roundNameEl) {
                roundNameEl.textContent = lang === 'es' ? round.name_es : round.name_en;
            }
            var trancheEl = document.getElementById('trancheInfo');
            if (trancheEl) {
                var trancheText = lang === 'es'
                    ? 'Presupuesto disponible para esta ronda: $' + round.tranche.toLocaleString()
                    : 'Budget available this round: $' + round.tranche.toLocaleString();
                trancheEl.textContent = trancheText;
            }
            var capEl = document.getElementById('roundBudgetCapDisplay');
            if (capEl) capEl.textContent = '$' + round.tranche.toLocaleString();
            var kpiPanel = document.getElementById('kpiPanel');
            if (kpiPanel) {
                kpiPanel.style.display = (state.currentPeriod || 1) > 1 ? 'block' : 'none';
            }

            // v1.1.0: re-enable submit once the (next) round is on screen.
            var _submitBtn = document.getElementById('nextPeriodBtn');
            if (_submitBtn) { _submitBtn.disabled = false; }
        }

        validateDecisions(decisions) {
            var _submitBtn = document.getElementById('nextPeriodBtn');
            if (_submitBtn && _submitBtn.disabled) { return false; }

            var unit = this.UNIT;
            var leverA = document.getElementById('leverA');
            var leverB = document.getElementById('leverB');
            var leverC = document.getElementById('leverC');
            var leverD = document.getElementById('leverD');
            var leverE = document.getElementById('leverE');
            var leverF = document.getElementById('leverF');
            decisions.leverA = leverA ? parseInt(leverA.value) * unit : 0;
            decisions.leverB = leverB ? parseInt(leverB.value) * unit : 0;
            decisions.leverC = leverC ? parseInt(leverC.value) * unit : 0;
            decisions.leverD = leverD ? parseInt(leverD.value) * unit : 0;
            decisions.leverE = leverE ? parseInt(leverE.value) * unit : 0;
            decisions.leverF = leverF ? parseInt(leverF.value) * unit : 0;
            var totalAlloc = decisions.leverA + decisions.leverB + decisions.leverC + decisions.leverD + decisions.leverE + decisions.leverF;
            var currentState = window.mySimulation.state;
            var idx = Math.min((currentState.currentPeriod || 1) - 1, this.ROUNDS.length - 1);
            var tranche = this.ROUNDS[idx].tranche;
            if (totalAlloc <= 0) {
                window.mySimulation.uiManager.showNotification(
                    window.mySimulation.t('warning_no_allocation'), 'warning'
                );
                return false;
            }
            if (totalAlloc > tranche) {
                window.mySimulation.uiManager.showNotification(
                    window.mySimulation.t('warning_over_budget'), 'warning'
                );
                return false;
            }
            if (totalAlloc > currentState.domainState.budget) {
                window.mySimulation.uiManager.showNotification(
                    window.mySimulation.t('warning_insufficient_budget'), 'warning'
                );
                return false;
            }
            this._updateBriefing(window.mySimulation.state);
            return true;
        }

        calculateResults(state) {
            var d = state.decisions;
            var ds = state.domainState;
            var period = state.currentPeriod;
            var noise = 0.85 + Math.random() * 0.30;
            var totalSpent = d.leverA + d.leverB + d.leverC + d.leverD + d.leverE + d.leverF;
            ds.budget -= totalSpent;
            ds.totalLeverA += d.leverA;
            ds.totalLeverB += d.leverB;
            ds.totalLeverC += d.leverC;
            ds.totalLeverD += d.leverD;
            ds.totalLeverE += d.leverE;
            ds.totalLeverF += d.leverF;
            if (period === 1 && ds.totalLeverA < 1500000) {
                ds.payerBetaExcluded = true;
            }
            var formBase = Math.min(90, 20 * Math.log2(1 + ds.totalLeverA / 1000000));
            if (ds.payerBetaExcluded) formBase = Math.min(formBase, 62);
            ds.formularyCoverage = Math.round(formBase * noise);
            ds.formularyCoverage = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, ds.formularyCoverage));
            var kolBase = Math.min(95, 15 * Math.log2(1 + ds.totalLeverB / 750000));
            ds.kolScore = Math.round(kolBase * noise);
            ds.kolScore = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, ds.kolScore));
            var sfCumul = ds.totalLeverC;
            var sfModel = 'lean';
            if (sfCumul >= 5500000) sfModel = 'intensive';
            else if (sfCumul >= 3000000) sfModel = 'balanced';
            var sfRampPenalty = 1.0;
            if (ds.sfModelPrevious === 'lean' && sfModel === 'intensive') sfRampPenalty = 0.65;
            else if (ds.sfModelPrevious === 'lean' && sfModel === 'balanced') sfRampPenalty = 0.80;
            else if (ds.sfModelPrevious === 'none' && sfModel === 'intensive') sfRampPenalty = 0.70;
            ds.sfModelPrevious = sfModel;
            var prescriberBase = 0;
            if (sfModel === 'lean') prescriberBase = 200;
            else if (sfModel === 'balanced') prescriberBase = 2500;
            else prescriberBase = 10200;
            ds.prescriberReach = Math.round(prescriberBase * sfRampPenalty * (noise * 0.5 + 0.5));
            var brandBase = Math.min(95, 18 * Math.log2(1 + ds.totalLeverD / 500000));
            var sfBrandBoost = ds.prescriberReach / 10200 * 15;
            ds.brandAwareness = Math.round(Math.min(98, (brandBase + sfBrandBoost) * noise));
            ds.brandAwareness = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, ds.brandAwareness));
            var persistBase = 42;
            var supportEffect = Math.min(35, 12 * Math.log2(1 + ds.totalLeverE / 500000));
            ds.persistenceRate = Math.round(Math.min(90, (persistBase + supportEffect) * (noise * 0.3 + 0.7)));
            ds.persistenceRate = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, ds.persistenceRate));
            var lcBase = Math.min(100, 20 * Math.log2(1 + ds.totalLeverF / 500000));
            ds.lifecycleScore = Math.round(lcBase * noise);
            ds.lifecycleScore = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, ds.lifecycleScore));
            var accessGate = ds.formularyCoverage / 100;
            var awarenessGate = ds.brandAwareness / 100;
            var preferenceRate = Math.min(0.55, 0.05 + (ds.kolScore / 100) * 0.35 + (ds.prescriberReach / 10200) * 0.15);
            var persistenceMultiplier = ds.persistenceRate / 100;
            var shareRaw = accessGate * awarenessGate * preferenceRate * persistenceMultiplier * 100;
            ds.marketShare = Math.round(Math.min(30, shareRaw) * 10) / 10;
            var eligiblePatients = 250000;
            var treatedPatients = Math.round(eligiblePatients * (ds.marketShare / 100));
            var annualRevPerPatient = 1168;
            var monthsInRound = period <= 2 ? 6 : 12;
            var roundRevenue = Math.round(treatedPatients * annualRevPerPatient * (monthsInRound / 12) * noise);
            if (period === 5) {
                var genericErosion = Math.max(0.30, 1 - (ds.lifecycleScore / 100) * 0.7);
                roundRevenue = Math.round(roundRevenue * genericErosion);
            }
            ds.cumulativeRevenue += roundRevenue;
            var commercialScore = Math.min(35, (ds.cumulativeRevenue / 80000000) * 35);
            var accessScore = Math.min(20, (ds.formularyCoverage / 80) * 20);
            var engagementScore = Math.min(20, ((ds.prescriberReach / 5000) * 10 + (ds.kolScore / 100) * 10));
            var patientScore = Math.min(15, (ds.persistenceRate / 67) * 15);
            var lifecycleScoreW = Math.min(10, (ds.lifecycleScore / 80) * 10);
            ds.leiScore = Math.round((commercialScore + accessScore + engagementScore + patientScore + lifecycleScoreW) * 10) / 10;
            ds.revenueHistory.push(roundRevenue);
            ds.shareHistory.push(ds.marketShare);
            ds.leiHistory.push(ds.leiScore);
            // v1.1.0: prevent double-submit re-entrancy (double budget spend / duplicated history).
            var _submitBtn = document.getElementById('nextPeriodBtn');
            if (_submitBtn) { _submitBtn.disabled = true; }

            var self = this;
            var nextPeriod = state.currentPeriod + 1;
            if (nextPeriod <= (state.maxPeriods || 5)) {
                setTimeout(function() {
                    self._updateBriefing({ currentPeriod: nextPeriod });
                    var sliders = ['leverA', 'leverB', 'leverC', 'leverD', 'leverE', 'leverF'];
                    sliders.forEach(function(id) {
                        var el = document.getElementById(id);
                        if (el) el.value = 0;
                    });
                    self._updateSliderDisplays();
                }, 500);
            }
            return {
                period: period,
                leverA: d.leverA,
                leverB: d.leverB,
                leverC: d.leverC,
                leverD: d.leverD,
                leverE: d.leverE,
                leverF: d.leverF,
                totalSpent: totalSpent,
                roundRevenue: roundRevenue,
                marketShare: ds.marketShare,
                formularyCoverage: ds.formularyCoverage,
                persistenceRate: ds.persistenceRate,
                leiScore: ds.leiScore,
                budget: ds.budget
            };
        }

        setupUI(uiManager) {
            uiManager.bind('currentDay', 'currentPeriod');
            uiManager.bind('maxPeriods', 'maxPeriods');
            uiManager.bind('budgetDisplay', 'domainState.budget',
                (v) => '$' + Math.round(v).toLocaleString());
            uiManager.bind('revenueDisplay', 'domainState.cumulativeRevenue',
                (v) => '$' + Math.round(v).toLocaleString());
            uiManager.bind('shareDisplay', 'domainState.marketShare',
                (v) => v + '%');
            uiManager.bind('leiDisplay', 'domainState.leiScore');
            uiManager.bind('formularyCoverageDisplay', 'domainState.formularyCoverage',
                (v) => v + '%');
            uiManager.bind('kolScoreDisplay', 'domainState.kolScore');
            uiManager.bind('prescriberReachDisplay', 'domainState.prescriberReach',
                (v) => Math.round(v).toLocaleString());
            uiManager.bind('persistenceDisplay', 'domainState.persistenceRate',
                (v) => v + '%');
            uiManager.bind('brandAwarenessDisplay', 'domainState.brandAwareness',
                (v) => v + '%');
            uiManager.bind('lifecycleScoreDisplay', 'domainState.lifecycleScore');
        }

        getChartConfig() {
            return {
                revenueChart: {
                    type: 'bar',
                    data: {
                        labels: [],
                        datasets: [{
                            label: 'Round Revenue ($)',
                            data: [],
                            backgroundColor: 'rgba(56,161,105,0.7)',
                            borderColor: '#38a169',
                            borderWidth: 2,
                            borderRadius: 6
                        }]
                    },
                    options: {
                        responsive: true,
                        maintainAspectRatio: false,
                        plugins: { title: { display: true, text: 'Revenue per Round' } },
                        scales: { y: { beginAtZero: true, ticks: { callback: function(v) { return '$' + (v / 1000000).toFixed(1) + 'M'; } } } }
                    }
                },
                shareChart: {
                    type: 'line',
                    data: {
                        labels: [],
                        datasets: [{
                            label: 'Market Share (%)',
                            data: [],
                            borderColor: '#d69e2e',
                            backgroundColor: 'rgba(214,158,46,0.1)',
                            borderWidth: 3,
                            fill: true,
                            tension: 0.3
                        }]
                    },
                    options: {
                        responsive: true,
                        maintainAspectRatio: false,
                        plugins: { title: { display: true, text: 'Market Share Trajectory' } },
                        scales: { y: { beginAtZero: true, max: 35 } }
                    }
                }
            };
        }

        getChartData(state) {
            var roundNames = ['R1', 'R2', 'R3', 'R4', 'R5'];
            var labels = state.domainState.revenueHistory.map(function(_, i) { return roundNames[i] || 'R' + (i + 1); });
            return {
                revenueChart: {
                    labels: labels,
                    datasets: [{ data: state.domainState.revenueHistory }]
                },
                shareChart: {
                    labels: labels,
                    datasets: [{ data: state.domainState.shareHistory }]
                }
            };
        }

        getHint(state, results) {
            var ds = state.domainState;
            var period = state.currentPeriod;
            if (period === 1 && ds.payerBetaExcluded) {
                return window.mySimulation.t('hint_payer_beta');
            }
            if (period >= 2 && ds.formularyCoverage < 50) {
                return window.mySimulation.t('hint_low_formulary');
            }
            if (period >= 3 && ds.prescriberReach < 500) {
                return window.mySimulation.t('hint_low_reach');
            }
            if (period >= 3 && ds.persistenceRate < 50) {
                return window.mySimulation.t('hint_low_persistence');
            }
            if (period >= 4 && ds.lifecycleScore < 20) {
                return window.mySimulation.t('hint_lifecycle_warning');
            }
            if (results.marketShare > 15) {
                return window.mySimulation.t('hint_strong_share');
            }
            return null;
        }

